printing.invalid = Iinsethingi zokugadangisa namkha ubukhulu besithombe abukalungi.
printing.limit = Umsebenzi wokugadangisa udlula umkhawulo: iinthombe ezima-200, amaphikseli aziingidi ezima-40 / amaphikseli azi-32768 emaphethelweni ngamunye wesithombe, namkha i-256 MiB yedatha ye-PDF ecindezelweko.
printing.profile_error = Isithombesi sinephrofayili yombala engakalungi, engavumelani naso namkha engasekelwako. Imigudu yombala ye-CMYK/Lab yesithombe sokuthoma idinga iphrofayili esebenzako efakwe esithombeni; i-RGB idinga iphrofayili ye-RGB.
printing.does_not_fit = Isithombe nge-DPI yaso yedokhumenti asingeni esitokisini lesi. Sebenzisa imodi yokulinganisa, igridi enemigqa namkha amakholomu ambalwa, namkha iphepha elikhulu.
printing.caption_limit = Umtlolo ohlathulula isithombe mude khulu kugridi le. Sebenzisa imigqa namkha amakholomu ambalwa, yifitjhanise namkha vala imitlolo ehlathululako.
printing.font_error = Ayikho ifonti etholakalako yomtlolo ohlathulula isithombe. Faka ifonti yomtlolo namkha vala imitlolo ehlathululako.
printing.no_document = Vula idokhumenti namkha khetha iinthombe egalari ngaphambi kokugadangisa.
printing.source_error = Isithombe esikhethiweko, ifayela elikhambisana naso elihleliweko namkha umtlolo osihlathululako azikafundeki. Akukho PDF ebulungiweko.
printing.save_error = I-PDF ayikabulungeki. Khetha igama elitjha lefayela kufolda ekuvumela ukutlola; amafayela akhona awajamiselelwa.
printing.downloaded = I-PDF idawunilodiwe. Yivule kusibukeli se-PDF ukuze uyigadangise ngo-100%.
